   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"cluster-overview\">\n<p class=\"lead\">Die System Services steuern den gesamten ECU-Lebenszyklus von Power-On über Wakeup, Betriebszustände, Modus-Arbitrierung (BswM) bis zum sicheren Herunterfahren und Programmlauf-Überwachung (WdgM).</p>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"sect\">Module im Cluster</h2>\n<div class=\"cards\">\n  <a class=\"card\" href=\"modules/ecum.html\">\n    <h3>ECU State Manager (EcuM)</h3>\n    <p>Controls ECU lifecycle states: Startup, Run, PostRun, Sleep, and Shutdown.</p>\n    <div class=\"card-meta\">\n      <span class=\"chip\">BSW ID 10</span>\n      <span class=\"chip\">65 APIs (52 Funktionen, 13 Typen)</span>\n      <span class=\"chip\"><code>#include &quot;EcuM.h&quot;</code></span>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n  <a class=\"card\" href=\"modules/bswm.html\">\n    <h3>BSW Mode Manager (BswM)</h3>\n    <p>Arbitrates mode requests and executes action lists to control system state transitions.</p>\n    <div class=\"card-meta\">\n      <span class=\"chip\">BSW ID 42</span>\n      <span class=\"chip\">35 APIs (32 Funktionen, 3 Typen)</span>\n      <span class=\"chip\"><code>#include &quot;BswM.h&quot;</code></span>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n  <a class=\"card\" href=\"modules/wdgm.html\">\n    <h3>Watchdog Manager (WdgM)</h3>\n    <p>Performs alive supervision, deadline supervision, and logical program flow monitoring.</p>\n    <div class=\"card-meta\">\n      <span class=\"chip\">BSW ID 13</span>\n      <span class=\"chip\">19 APIs (11 Funktionen, 8 Typen)</span>\n      <span class=\"chip\"><code>#include &quot;WdgM.h&quot;</code></span>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  }
 ],
